  "title": "Bristol Life Through A Lens",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>18th July 2015</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Our photographer Stef Formica has been out and about in Bristol this week armed with her camera and capturing life throughout the city. Here&#8217;s a few shots of everyday Bristol life being lived by some of the individuals who make up this vibrant and diverse place we&#8217;re very happy to call home.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9108\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-1-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"Bristol People\" width=\"675\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-1-675x450.jpg 675w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-1-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-1-120x80.jpg 120w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-1.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-3.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-9142\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-3-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"bp-3\" width=\"675\" height=\"450\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-3-675x450.jpg 675w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-3-120x80.jpg 120w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-3.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 675px) 100vw, 675px\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/07/bp-2.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class